WEBVTT

00:09:00.116 --> 00:09:04.636
And right now, on an out breath,

00:09:04.676 --> 00:09:08.276
we have a chance to release that tension.

00:09:08.276 --> 00:09:10.396
This is possible right away.

00:09:11.916 --> 00:09:15.596
If we come back to ourselves
in this moment

00:09:15.596 --> 00:09:19.236
and we find sadness,

00:09:19.276 --> 00:09:22.716
we have a chance to embrace it.

00:09:24.116 --> 00:09:27.196
If we find fear,

00:09:27.196 --> 00:09:30.836
anger, despair,